<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11862"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tac<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tac<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 19, 2005 - 5:45 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->bmodul, <BR> <BR>This is a long shot but the book &#34;Smoke Screen&#34; by Robert Sabbag is about Allen Long considered one of the biggest pot smuggling kingpins of the 1970s. <BR> <BR>In this book Long describes life smuggling Columbian Santa Marta Gold from Santa Marta, Columbia using DC 3s &amp; 4s.  <BR> <BR>I wonder if the men that parished in the crash can be cross referenced with Long or for that matter George Jung the infamous cocaine king.  .  .   <BR> <BR>What if any is the connection of drugs to Rader ? <!--/Text--></td></tr>
