<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12237"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 25, 2005 - 2:45 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->B, I hav been told that people are having  hard time follow this thread, they have no idea what we are talking about, I am going to leave it up to you to explain. we are at a stand still with the three guys in this plane and I have already been asked questions about the connection, I also think that you should put the Pittsburg map we have somewhere on the board, and maybe someone who lives there can go there to id the buildings<!--/Text--></td></tr>
