<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12249"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 25, 2005 - 7:00 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->page 54 nightmare in wichita &#34;The Sun article did talk about the crashed aircraft that was carying marijuana, ....we feel the drug motive to be doubtful&#34;. said Cromwell.  Page 11 &#34;In 2004 Charlie told me he thinks that his father knew something was seriuosly wrong.........he didnt know what the problem was, believed it has something to do with his father&#39;s covert operations for the government while he was in the AF<!--/Text--></td></tr>
